    "conf_pre2003": {
      "en": "The pre-2003 record has low confidence because the early Terra observations require a statistical bridge to Aqua. The year 2000 includes only November and December.\nNovember 2000 in Peru: at least 20,862.2 fire cell-days (90%: 9,484.3–26,181.8). The wide range is essential; the historical classification baseline starts in 2003.",
      "es": "El registro anterior a 2003 tiene baja confianza porque las primeras observaciones de Terra requieren un puente estadístico hacia Aqua. El año 2000 incluye solo noviembre y diciembre.\nNoviembre de 2000 en Perú: al menos 20,862.2 fire cell-days (90%: 9,484.3–26,181.8). El rango amplio es esencial; la base histórica de clasificación empieza en 2003.",
      "chart": null
    },
    "forecast_next": {
      "en": "Forecast, separate from observed activity: Peru's August–October 2027 outlook is 27,300.8 fire cell-days (90% forecast range: 18,223.6–35,565.1), initialized in 2026-10.\nThe separate December 2026 monthly forecast is 1,440.0 fire cell-days (90%: 752.7–3,241.4). Published seasonal method: climatology; no model skill over climatology at this lead. This outlook can inform preparedness planning; it is not an operational recommendation.",
