    "compare_naive": {
      "en": "In the held-out validation, the naive sum's mean error is 333.9% versus 3.8% for the harmonized method. These are validation metrics, not the size of the 2012 jump.\nThe emulator offers a MODIS-equivalent comparison and a continuity scenario after MODIS. Its uncertainty and drift limits remain visible; neither product identifies causes or burned area.",
